.tokensave
*.original.md
.GEMINI.md
CLAUDE.md
plan.md
# The repo holds what the shell needs to run. Plans, design notes, changelog,
# probes and dev tooling stay on the developer's machine.
*.md
!README.md
!.github/**/*.md
docs/
probes/
scripts/lint.py
scripts/lint-baseline.txt
scripts/shot.sh
scripts/test_notif_rules.js
scripts/docker-test/

